+/*
+ * RT713 exposes two DAIs (0 = jack, 1 = DMIC), unlike RT712 whose DMIC
+ * DAI sits at index 2 behind the amp DAI, so it needs its own endpoint
+ * list rather than reusing rt712_endpoints.
